WEBVTT

00:00.418 --> 00:12.533
agar hamaaray pass aik equation hai 7x

00:12.533 --> 00:15.867
isko solve karnay se pehlay

00:15.867 --> 00:19.737
mujhe yeh sochna hai keh 7x ka matlab kya hai?

00:19.737 --> 00:22.430
agar hamaray pass aik ibaarat hai 7x=14

00:22.430 --> 00:39.427
iska matlab hai keh7 zarab x, yaani hum 7 ko aise hindsay se zarab dein keh jawab 14 aaye

00:39.427 --> 00:43.533
aap isko zubaani solve kar saktay hain

00:43.533 --> 00:45.743
ya aap 7 ka pahaara bhi parh saktay hain

00:45.743 --> 00:48.762
agar 7 zarab aik se shuru karein tou 7 zarab aik ki value hai 7

00:48.762 --> 00:54.010
7 zarab 2 ki value hai 14. Tou iska matlab hai keh x ki value yaqeenan 2 hogi

00:54.010 --> 00:56.424
yeh jawab ya solution tou assni se nikal aaya

00:56.424 --> 00:59.257
is qisam ki asaan aur simple equation ka solution tou araam se nikaala ja sakta hai

01:08.267 --> 01:10.728
lekin agar equation kuch lambi ya mushkil ho tou zubaani ya simple tareeqay se iska jawab nikaalna mushkil hai

01:18.251 --> 01:21.920
iss equation 7x = 14 ka matlab hai keh 7 ko kisi aise number se zarab di jaaye keh iska jawab 14 aaye

01:21.920 --> 01:24.753
algebra mein aksar x ka sign istemaal nahin kiya jaata

01:26.588 --> 01:28.422
agar kisi do hindsoun ko ya aik hindsay aur aik anjaan hindsay ko zarab deni ho to agar unko aik doosray ke saath likha jaaye

01:28.422 --> 01:30.419
to iska bhi yehi matlab hot hai

01:30.419 --> 01:32.090
keh inko aapas mein zarab d jaa rahi hai

01:32.090 --> 01:34.087
yeh sirf isko likhnay ka aik assan tareeqa hai

01:34.087 --> 01:36.595
hum x is liye nahin likhtay keh aksar yeh jaan paana mushkil hai keh

01:36.595 --> 01:41.067
asal mein yeh x ya zarab ka nishaan hai ya keh yeh aik variable x hai

01:42.400 --> 01:49.412
Aksar logon ki likhaayi bhi aisi hoti hai keh 'x' kuch ajeeb lag sakta hai aur logon ko confuse kar sakta hai

01:49.412 --> 01:52.400
keh kisi no do baar tou x nahin likh diya.

01:54.985 --> 01:57.400
to aam taur par jab equations par kaam kiya jaata hai,

01:57.400 --> 01:58.933
khaas taur par jin mein x aik variable ho

01:58.933 --> 02:01.255
tou aisi equations mein zarab ka nishaan istemaal nahin kiya jaata

02:01.255 --> 02:05.434
kuch jagah par log sirf . ya dot ka nishaan bhi zarab ki jagah istemaal karte hain

02:06.595 --> 02:10.403
jaise 7. x(yaani 7 zarab variable x) = 14

02:10.403 --> 02:13.004
magar dot notation itna aam taur par istemaal nahin hota.

02:13.004 --> 02:14.908
agar aik variable ya anjaan number ho x aur usko aik aur hindsay se zarab deni ho tou usko

02:14.908 --> 02:16.766
7x likha jaa sakta hai

02:16.766 --> 02:19.738
iska matlab hai 7 zarab x

02:19.738 --> 02:22.478
iss equation ko hal karnay ke liye aap sochein keh 7 zarab x ka asal matlab kya hai

02:22.478 --> 02:25.403
isko iss tarah bhi dekha jaa sakta hai keh

02:35.388 --> 02:38.081
keh x kay hindsay ko 7 baar khud se jamah kiya jaaye

02:38.081 --> 02:40.403
jaise keh pahaaray mein hota hai

02:40.403 --> 02:48.484
yaani x jamah x jamah x jamah x jamah x

02:48.484 --> 02:51.735
yeh paanch baar x jamah hua, ab iss mein 2 aur x jamah karein

02:51.735 --> 02:55.589
yaani qul mila kar 7x (saat x ) ho gaye

03:03.716 --> 03:07.664
hamaari equation mein 7 x , 14 ke baraabar hain

03:11.472 --> 03:14.072
agar main 14 cheezein banaoon

03:14.072 --> 03:19.831
yaani aik(1), do(2), teen, chaar, paanch, cheh, saat, aath,

03:19.831 --> 03:23.467
nau, dus, gyaarah, baarah, taira, chauda tak

03:23.467 --> 03:26.936
hamaara matlab hai keh ywh 7x in chauda cheezon ke baraabar hai

03:26.936 --> 03:29.398
yeh statements bilkul baraabar hain

03:29.398 --> 03:32.741
inko iss tarah banaanay se yeh behtar samajh mein aata hai

03:35.388 --> 03:37.664
keh hum equation ke dono taraf ko saat(7) hison mein kaise taqseem kar saktay hain

03:47.867 --> 03:53.407
aam taur par jab hum aik equation ko asaan tareeqay se likhna chahtay hain

03:53.407 --> 03:56.147
tou uskay coefficient, ya variable se zarab honay walay hindsay ko nikaalnay ki koshish kartay hain

04:03.159 --> 04:05.249
agar hum equation ke dono jaanib ko 7 se divide ya taqseem karein tou iss equation ko assan tareeqay se likha jaa sakta hai

04:05.249 --> 04:07.757
iss see 7 ka hindsa cancel ho jaaye ga

04:07.757 --> 04:12.494
dono jaanib ko 7 se divide karein

04:12.494 --> 04:16.255
tou 7 ko 7 se hi taqseem karnay se 7 cancel ho jaaye ga

04:16.255 --> 04:18.252
aur sirf x reh jaata hai

04:18.252 --> 04:22.664
doosri jaanib 14 ko 7 se taqseem karein tou jawaab 2 aayega

04:22.664 --> 04:26.751
tou iss tarah x ki value 2 aati hai

04:26.751 --> 04:29.398
isko iss tarah se socha ja sakta hai

04:29.398 --> 04:32.742
keh agar aik equation ko balance karna ho, tou jo aik side par jamah (+) ya tafreeq (-) ya zarab(x) ya taqseem(/) kiya jaata hai

04:32.742 --> 04:36.410
wohi = sign ke doosri jaanib bhi kiya jaata hai, takeh equation balanced rahe.

04:36.410 --> 04:37.664
Hum ne aik side ko 7 se taqseem kiya, tou doosri side ko bhi karengay, kyoonkeh yeh aik equation hai

04:37.664 --> 04:39.800
iski left side, right side ke baraabar hai

04:39.800 --> 04:43.469
jo left side ko kiya jaata hai, wohi doosr side ko bhi

04:43.469 --> 04:46.163
balance karnay ke liye karna zaroori hai

04:50.482 --> 04:54.986
ab jabkeh left side ko 7 se taqseem kiya gaya hai

04:54.986 --> 04:56.054
main right sode ko bhi 7 hison mein baant deta hoon

04:56.054 --> 04:59.816
yaani 7 x 's ko, saat hison miein baantoon ga

05:04.460 --> 05:07.664
aur right jaanib ko bhi saat groups mein taqseem kar deta hoon

05:11.400 --> 05:16.999
aik do teen.............. cheh(6) saat(7) tak

05:16.999 --> 05:19.599
agar left side , right par di gai har cheez ke baraabar hai tou

05:19.599 --> 05:26.008
iss taraf ki aik x
